%" height="100%" fill="#71301E" filter="url(#claude-prompt-routing-Rcp7mqtltb-grain-dark)" opacity="0.32"></rect></svg><div class="relative z-10"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/70">Claude looks it up</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-[30px] font-normal leading-none tracking-[-0.045em]" style="font-family:'Andersen', serif">Your pages can win these</h3><div class="mt-7 divide-y divide-white/25"><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_96px] items-center gap-3 py-3 text-sm"><span class="text-white">â€œ<!-- -->best CRM 2026<!-- -->â€</span><strong class="text-right font-semibold tabular-nums text-white">9 times in 10</strong></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_96px] items-center gap-3 py-3 text-sm"><span class="text-white">â€œ<!-- -->cheapest CRM<!-- -->â€</span><strong class="text-right font-semibold tabular-nums text-white">7 in 10</strong></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_96px] items-center gap-3 py-3 text-sm"><span class="text-white">â€œ<!-- -->best CRM<!-- -->â€</span><strong class="text-right font-semibold tabular-nums text-white">1 in 3</strong></div></div><p class="mt-6 border-t border-white/30 pt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/85">Spend here: pricing pages, dated content, and comparison sites.</p></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-stone-200 p-6 md:border-l md:border-t-0 sm:p-7"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="absolute inset-0 block"><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="#E7E5E4"></rect><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="#FAFAF9" filter="url(#claude-prompt-routing-Rcp7mqtltb-grain-light)" opacity="0.3"></rect><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="#78716C" filter="url(#claude-prompt-routing-Rcp7mqtltb-grain-dark)" opacity="0.32"></rect></svg><div class="relative z-10"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-stone-600">Claude already decided</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-[30px] font-nor