left.</p></div><div><span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#C65F3D]">03</span><p class="mt-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-700">Put comparisons, worth-it, and how-to prompts on the right.</p></div></div><p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900">The ratio between the two columns is your content budget split.</p></aside></div><div class="relative mt-14"><div class="hidden" aria-hidden="true"><div class="h-14 border-y border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/70"></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3"><div class="h-28 bg-[#C65F3D]"></div><div class="h-28 bg-stone-100"></div><div class="h-28 border border-stone-200 bg-white"></div></div></div></div></section><div class="relative mt-20 md:mt-28"><div class="space-y-20 md:space-y-28" aria-hidden="false"><section id="triggers" class="scroll-mt-28"><header><p class="mb-5 w-fit rounded-full border border-[rgba(82,88,24,0.4)] bg-[#F4FBB8] px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-[#525818] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(74,43,38,0.06)]">Play <!-- -->02</p><h2 class="max-w-[700px] text-[40px] font-normal leading-none tracking-[-0.05em] text-stone-950 md:text-[48px] lg:text-[56px]" style="font-family:'Andersen', serif">Index your business in Brave Search, Claude's closest-matching index.</h2><div class="mt-7 max-w-[680px] text-[17px] leading-[1.65] tracking-[-0.015em] text-stone-600 md:text-lg"><p>A decade of SEO advice pointed at Google. The pages Claude reads look much more like the results sitting in Brave.</p></div></header><div class="mt-12 space-y-10"><figure class="relative border-y border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/70 p-6 sm:p-8"><svg width="0" height="0" aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute"><defs><filter id="claude-index-overlap-R3397mqtltb-grain-light" x="-5%" y="-5%" width="110%" height="110%" color-interpolation-filters="sRGB"><feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.76" numOctaves="2" seed="23" stitchTiles="stitch" result="noise"></feTurbulence><feColorMatrix i