code>. If nothing comes back, you are not in the index.</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[36px_1fr] gap-4 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-700"><span class="font-semibold text-[#C65F3D]">0<!-- -->2</span><span>Submit your homepage at Braveâ€™s URL submission page. This is a request to be found, not a ranking guarantee.</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[36px_1fr] gap-4 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-700"><span class="font-semibold text-[#C65F3D]">0<!-- -->3</span><span>Check that your robots.txt and firewall rules are not blocking crawlers or unknown bots.</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[36px_1fr] gap-4 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-700"><span class="font-semibold text-[#C65F3D]">0<!-- -->4</span><span>Keep your sitemap current and your internal links clean enough for a crawler to follow.</span></li></ol></aside></div></section><section id="source-pool" class="scroll-mt-28"><header><p class="mb-5 w-fit rounded-full border border-[rgba(82,88,24,0.4)] bg-[#F4FBB8] px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-[#525818] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(74,43,38,0.06)]">Play <!-- -->03</p><h2 class="max-w-[700px] text-[40px] font-normal leading-none tracking-[-0.05em] text-stone-950 md:text-[48px] lg:text-[56px]" style="font-family:'Andersen', serif">Move your page-two rankings into Brave's top ten.</h2><div class="mt-7 max-w-[680px] text-[17px] leading-[1.65] tracking-[-0.015em] text-stone-600 md:text-lg"><p>The top ten positions perform similarly after Claude reads them. Position eleven is usually never read at all.</p></div></header><div class="mt-12 space-y-10"><figure class="relative border-y border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/70 p-6 sm:p-8"><svg width="0" height="0" aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute"><defs><filter id="claude-ranking-threshold-R3597mqtltb-grain-light" x="-5%" y="-5%" width="110%" height="110%" color-interpolation-filters="sRGB"><feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.76" numOctaves="2"